  "prefLabel": "Bfc 103.01 Composition of Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bfc 103.01 Composition of Board.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 153:2, the board shall consist of 11 members, appointed by the governor, with the advice and consent of the council, for a term specified by law.\n\n(b) One member shall be designated chair by the governor.\n\n(c) The board shall elect a vice-chair at its annual meeting.\n\n(d) The chair shall preside over all meetings of the board.\n\n(e) In the absence of the chair at a meeting of the board, the vice chair shall preside.\n\nSource. #10553-A, eff 3-25-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bfc100.html"
